Falsifies `grant_plan::line::verification::a_split_never_indexes_past_the_line`.

The defect: the output operator reads the byte after it, to tell `>` from `>>`, without first asking whether there is one, so a line that ends with the operator indexes past its end.

Expected to fail: the bounds check on `line[i + 1]` inside `read_redirections`.

